+      "source_dependencies": "The original input independent-derivation.md (24,027 bytes, SHA-256 f38c085ab5b15368e6989a1fd6298490f3b671f5a6c3a01bcdc81b516022bc33), its equations (1), (8), (11), (11a), (17), (26)-(29), G1-G4 and its section 8 (lines 11-16, 66, 269, 352, 375-381); Root's relayed A/B findings (positive integer M, integer R; Math193/6242959634) (line 18). Standard results: Hadamard's inequality (line 246), Jensen's inequality (line 140), Mills-type tail bounds (line 183), Sylvester's criterion (line 250), Cholesky factors and Schur complements (lines 271-279), Gaussian Hilbert-space regression and Cauchy-Schwarz (lines 354-361), compact Sobolev embedding (line 363). README.md names a later finite-L/GAD alignment proof as a separate identification route that this packet does not consume. PROOF.md also cites SOURCE_BINDINGS_V1.json, SOURCE_BINDINGS_V2.json, REVIEW_INPUT_V2.md, CORRECTION_LOG_V2.md, V1_TO_V2_TEXT_DIFF.patch and the preserved V1 (lines 18, 414); none of these is in the packet. The original input is identified by a local path (line 13) and its general Rice reference is cited (lines 16, 383); the original equation (8) is used in control 2 (line 402).",
