+      "attempted": "PROOF.md gives prose proofs of Lemma 0, Lemma F₃, Lemma T₁, Theorem C3, Proposition G, Corollary G′ and Proposition G″ (§§1-5), remarks with exploration numerics (§6), exact controls (§7) and review slices (§8). The packet also holds author_controls.py with author_controls_stdout.json, CLAIM.md, AUTHOR_CONTROLS_COMMENT.md, EXPLORATION_COMMENT.md, read-request and review summonses, and review records REVIEW_SLICE_A.md, REVIEW_SLICE_B.md and REVIEW_SLICE_C.md (each PASS on its slice only).",
