+      "isolation": "The packet contains no Lean source at this cut (0 .lean files), so nothing in the CLOSED domain (Math-/formal/ResearchFormalCoreR1 and main/formal/UniversalLaw at their admitted cuts) can import it. This record excludes mathematical promotion from this region; source navigation and diagnostic uses remain outside that admission. The composer must adopt it before it becomes a terminal quarantine.",
