+          "text": "**Lemma LE_K.** Let `f` be `C⁴` with the exact pins at a gap `k ∈ K`, with `y ∈ Rsec`. Suppose `Rch ≤ w`, `w ≥ 1` and `r(1 + k_+)w ≤ L/4`.\n- **(i)** For every `ξ ∈ K_raw`, `|E_r(ξ)| ≤ K₂(K) N r w²·|ξ − raw M|² ≤ 4K₂(K) N r w²·|v|²`.\n- **(ii)** `4h ≥ 2ℓ_M|v|²`, where `ℓ_M := min(1, a_M/(γ² + 72))`. (A4 calls this margin `ℓ`.)\n- **Consequently**, if `η_K N < ℓ_M`, then `F_r(raw M + 2v) > 0`."
+        },
+        {
+          "line_start": 92,
+          "line_end": 96,
+          "text": "**Corollary LE_K (the rejected certificate at gap `k`).** For `w ≥ 1` with `r(1 + k_+)w ≤ L/4`, put on `Rsec`\n\n    Good_LE,K(r, w) := {Rch ≤ w,  E0(r, w) < μ/2,  η_K N(γ² + 72) < a_M,  η_K N < 1}.\n\nThis event is measurable, and on it `D_f(M_r) > f(S_r)`."
+        },
+        {
+          "line_start": 109,
+          "line_end": 111,
+          "text": "**Lemma B′_K (the endpoint strip at gap `k`).** Assume also `η_K ≤ 1`. Then\n\n    μ_r(D_Λ ∩ Rsec ∩ {η_K N(γ² + 72) ≥ a_M  or  η_K N ≥ 1}) ≤ C_K[H³η_K + rH⁴√η_K]."
+        },
+        {
+          "line_start": 118,
+          "line_end": 120,
+          "text": "**Lemma Band_K (the decision band at general `p`).** Assume also `w ≥ 5` and `r(1 + k_+)w ≤ L/4`. For `0 < d ≤ 1/4` and every fixed real `p ≥ 1`,\n\n    μ_r(D_Λ ∩ (E ∪ Rsec) ∩ {E0 ≥ |μ|/2}) ≤ C_{K,p}[d + rH⁴ + H³(e/d)^p],    e = rw⁴."
+        },
+        {
+          "line_start": 130,
+          "line_end": 134,
+          "text": "**Theorem QFE′_K.** Work in C103's setting. For each fixed `β ∈ (0, 2/3)` there are `C_{K,β} < ∞` and `r_{K,β} > 0`, uniform over `b ∈ B₀`, `k ∈ K` and all frames, such that for `r ≤ r_{K,β}`\n\n    ‖ν_r^F − ν_0^F‖_var ≤ C_{K,β} r^β,    1 − p_r = r³(α₁ + α₂) + O_{K,β}(r^{3+β}).\n\nHere `α_j` are CUB's G11 coefficients at gap `k` (C103 (S34)). The conditional raw-jet law given `F_r` converges at the same rate."
+        },
+        {
+          "line_start": 192,
+          "line_end": 196,
+          "text": "**Corollary SE_K.** Fix `Λ ≥ 1` and `ε ∈ (0, 2/3)`. Set `w = r^{−1/12}` and `d = r^{2/3−ε}`, and fix a real `p ≥ 2/(3ε)`. Uniformly over `b`, `k ∈ K` and frames, for all sufficiently small `r`,\n\n    Q_r^W(D_Λ ∩ (E ∪ Rsec) ∩ (H_r Δ E)) ≤ C_{K,Λ,ε} r^{11/3−ε}.\n\nIn particular, `Q_r^W(D_Λ ∩ Rsec ∩ H_r)` and `Q_r^W(D_Λ ∩ E \\ H_r)` are both `O(r^{11/3−ε})`."
+        }
