+          "line_end": 222,
+          "text": "**Theorem V (the transfer).** Let `d ∈ {2, 3}` and `L₀ ∈ {10, 24}`. For every real `L ≥ L₀`, `|c₃(L) − c₃^∞| ≤ η_c𝒮_d` and\n`|R_{2/3}(L) − R^∞| ≤ η_R𝒮_d`, with `η_c` and `η_R` the entries of the table above for that `L₀`. The `R_{2/3}` bound is at\n#244 Theorem A's conditional scope; the `c₃` bound does not use #244."
