+      "exact_boundary": "Covered: (B1) for every Borel lifetime set under the stated pointwise hypotheses; (B2) almost everywhere where densities exist, with integrability supplied separately; the §4 exponent conversions on fixed compact mark sets; the three explicit counterexamples and the TV bound exactly as stated in §6; (C1) for every integer count; and Q_r^W(E) <= C r^beta/(2 z_*), only under (C2) and the deterministic inclusion. Not covered: the §5 unrestricted error ledger (:219-254), which restates R §§6-7 and P §14 and is not the audit's own statement; any claim that (C2) or the inclusion holds for the Gaussian field; and any claim that the dependencies of the T24-planar target are discharged.",
