+          "text": "1. **ζ lives along the scale direction.** Let N_F(L, d) = Σ_{j∈ℤ^d} e^{−2π²|j|²/L²} be the\n   project's Fourier normalizer, which equals Θ(2π/L²)^d. For Re s > d,\n\n       ∫_0^∞ (N_F(L, d) − 1) L^{−s−1} dL = ½ (2π²)^{−s/2} Γ(s/2) Z_d(s/2)."
