+          "text": "4. **The lobe area as a weighted integral of ∂_tH.** For consecutive zeros a < c of H_t,\n   ∫_a^c H_t = ½ ∫_a^c (x − a)(c − x) ∂_t H_t dx. This is the integration-by-parts identity"
