+          "line_start": 164,
+          "line_end": 165,
+          "text": "**Theorem CONT-1.** The LPW local event G_r = E_r ∩ {M₄ ≤ K} satisfies\nG_r ⊂ A.loc ⊂ A ⊂ F_r = {D_f(M) ≠ S}, exactly, on Reg ∩ TYP."
+        },
+        {
+          "file": "incoming/claude-bundle-v3-native-copies-20260928/K3_SIDE24_LB/LPW_CONSTANT/OPTIMIZATION_ANALYSIS.md",
+          "line_start": 171,
+          "line_end": 174,
+          "text": "**Consequence (Theorem).** For all 0 < r ≤ r₀,\nliminf_{r→0} (1 − q(r, 6/5))/r³ ≥ liminf P_r(G_r)/r³ ≥ c_v2 = 260/(2082000000000·2⁴⁰·10²¹)\n≥ 1.13e-43 > 0 (v2's certified pair, re-certified by H1's v3). The LPW event is a\n**certified lower bound on the failure coefficient**, not the coefficient itself."
