+          "line_end": 59,
+          "text": "For six blocks of demand408 and the five adjacent-pair constraints {i,i+1}, i=0,...,4, the optimum is816. One compressed solution is408 labels on {0,2,4} and408 on {1,3,5}. A pair constraint proves the816 lower bound. Pairwise-disjoint palettes would use2448."
