+          "line_start": 16,
+          "line_end": 16,
+          "text": "The repeated value 6.239277637492383...e-44 is instead produced by replacing the delivered denominator with 3790000000000 (3.79e12). That is a smaller denominator, not an upper bound for the delivered B3_rat. Rounding an upper denominator downward cannot support a lower-bound computation."
