+          "line_start": 26,
+          "line_end": 34,
+          "text": "The code and report define zeta = |X| + |Y| for independent standard normal X,Y and use\n\n    E[zeta^4] = 12 + 16/pi.\n\nBut the exact moments are E|X|=sqrt(2/pi), E|X|^2=1, E|X|^3=2sqrt(2/pi), E|X|^4=3. Therefore\n\n    E[(|X|+|Y|)^4]\n      = 2 E|X|^4 + 8 E|X|^3 E|Y| + 6 E|X|^2 E|Y|^2\n      = 12 + 32/pi."
