+      "placeholder_scan": "Read all six listed Lean files in full: SourceLifetimeAxiomAudit.lean (81 lines), SourceLifetimeControls.lean (124), SourceLifetimeField.lean (92), SourceLifetimeGeometry.lean (98), SourceThetaBridge.lean (266) and inputs/Lifetime.lean (634). Also ran a comment-stripped token scan over them.\n\nNone of the following appears: sorry; admit; an axiom or constant declaration; opaque; implemented_by; extern; unsafe; native_decide; decide; instance (Decidable instances included); set_option; macro, syntax, elab or notation declarations; attribute commands; simprocs; Float.\n\nAttribute tags: @[simp] on actualGaussianFieldInterface_carrier, _law and _field (SourceLifetimeField.lean:81, 84, 87) and on coordinates_apply (SourceLifetimeGeometry.lean:18). They register simp lemmas and do not weaken checking.\n\nThe only metaprogramming is in SourceLifetimeAxiomAudit.lean:\n- imports Lean.Elab.Command and Lean.Util.CollectAxioms (lines 4-5);\n- #print axioms at lines 13-15;\n- `open Lean Elab Command in run_cmd do` at lines 17-81. The block takes a local copy of the environment with setExporting false (line 19) and lists the constants of 18 named modules. It checks each one against env.checked (line 42) and calls Lean.collectAxioms (line 44). It throws on any axiom outside {propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound} (lines 46-48) and on omitted required names (lines 78-80), and it logs. It adds no declaration.\nThe word 'axiom' at line 48 is inside a throwError message.\n\nSourceThetaBridge.lean has private theorems and defs at lines 67, 93, 100, 114, 117, 124, 128, 134, 140, 192, 203 and 215. None is a placeholder.\n\ninputs/Lifetime.lean has only abbrev, def and structure declarations and no theorem. Its structure GaussianFieldInterface has the square-bracket fields mΩ and isProb (lines 156, 160).\n\nThe 13 other inputs/*.lean modules that these files import transitively are outside this record's file list and were not read line by line. A supplementary comment-stripped token scan of them at the cut found no sorry, admit, axiom, opaque, implemented_by, extern, unsafe, native_decide, decide, macro, syntax, elab, run_cmd or Float. It did find:\n- instance coefficientLaw_isProbabilityMeasure (GaussianSeriesFoundation.lean:20, body infer_instance);\n- set_option maxHeartbeats 800000 in, on finite_product_summable (SpectralWeights.lean:51). This raises the elaboration budget of a lemma that theta_summable uses;\n- attribute [local instance] actualChartedSpace (SourceTorusC4.lean:50, SourceSmoothCarrier.lean:187).\nNone of these weakens kernel checking.",
+      "vacuity_notes": "The principal object is the def actualGaussianFieldInterface. It builds an inhabitant of GaussianFieldInterface d L for every d : ℕ (d = 0 included) and every L with 0 < L. Its only hypothesis, 0 < L, can be met. That def witnesses actualGaussianFieldInterface_exists (Nonempty), so the existence statement is not trivial.\n\nStatements that are rfl or definitional: actualGaussianFieldInterface_carrier, _law and _field (SourceLifetimeField.lean:81-90), and literalCarrier, literalLaw and literalField (SourceLifetimeControls.lean:17-26).\n\nRestatements of the constructed structure's own fields, or aliases: unrestrictedEndpoint (Controls:14-15) aliases the constructor. sameCarrierOrders (28-33) and everyLatticeTranslation (107-110) project its fields.\n\ncancelledSample (78-81) is a pointwise algebraic identity. cancelledQuad (74-76) has an unused hypothesis _hL. The source labels its degenerate-case computations as controls: dimensionZeroTheta, dimensionZeroSpectralNormalizer, emptyQuad and euclideanNormSquared.\n\ninputs/Lifetime.lean asserts nothing. Its Prop-valued shapes are definitions only: ParentUniformSelectionA, ParentCompactWindowDensityB, ParentUnrestrictedLeadingDensityC, RemainderBoundedR1, PlanarElderLowerE2, PlanarTwoSidedRateE4 and PlanarDensityGapE11. Their docstrings record two limits. The universal closure over interface inhabitants is false (lines 477, 579, 596). RemainderBoundedR1 holds vacuously if no c satisfies the parent property (line 558). No theorem in this group asserts any of these shapes.",
+      "own_kernel_evidence": "The group's own directory holds author-run receipts. In each of the 26 final-run receipts, source_before and source_after give sha256 values for all 19 Lean files, and they equal the sha256 computed here from git show of each file at the cut.\n\nKernel receipts, all in evidence/final/final-runs/. Each has command @PINNED_LEAN_RUNTIME@/bin/leanchecker -v <module>, returncode 0, timed_out false, integrity_error null, and stdout 'replaying <module>' whose sha256 matches the receipt's stdout_sha256:\n- 20261018T002544Z-kernel-SourceThetaBridge-fbaa7114/RECEIPT.json: SourceThetaBridge.lean sha256 c03df303f47ac056af332ad421a6720966464c474ee77e671f85242d30f6cc9b, 159.31 s, olean d5474767...\n- 20261018T002826Z-kernel-SourceLifetimeGeometry-0e7a3685: 8ec4b18959055f20d849337e44a70d0c5b39b7959b54cb4d7b6c2a473ee0612d.\n- 20261018T003115Z-kernel-SourceLifetimeField-10f8e74c: daf0949a14d4ed8bd19fbdc564f0f8c3fad72ed243de73e39d65b2951576919a.\n- 20261018T003401Z-kernel-SourceLifetimeControls-4623c055: f50da7cb374c3e75280ae465696b657902f9070cff1256784dc28050017cd171.\n- 20261018T003650Z-kernel-SourceLifetimeAxiomAudit-348880d8: fea8df29106f295238b3a039bb2aae350167a9ada2326d6d00ba6f6663be52c3.\n\nA failed earlier attempt is preserved: 20261018T002219Z-kernel-SourceThetaBridge-9ba2eb35 (returncode 1, 3.94 s). Its stderr reads 'could not execute external process 'lean'': leanchecker could not start its lean child (README line 7). This is an environment failure, not a kernel rejection.\n\nCompile receipts (@PINNED_LEAN_RUNTIME@/bin/lean -j2 -M4096 ..., returncode 0) exist for all 19 modules, including:\n- build-Lifetime-5d16e5f2: inputs/Lifetime.lean sha256 90f4892608e953ecc696bb32ea159d1c178ceb8a1c6edfd11acfceb14af462c6, 215.25 s;\n- build-SourceThetaBridge-944396e3, build-SourceLifetimeGeometry-ff7a456a, build-SourceLifetimeField-bb85810f and build-SourceLifetimeControls-b95a48e0.\n\nThe audit compile 20261018T001437Z-build-SourceLifetimeAxiomAudit-20f1