+      "source_hypotheses": "Actual-source modules: period L with hL : L ≠ 0, an arbitrary fixed height b : ℝ, natural derivative/moment orders k and n, and radii 0 < r < δ (or r ≠ 0 for the pin transforms). The model objects are imported unchanged from inputs. From I4SmoothCarrier/I4Smooth: SmoothSample, smoothLaw, smoothSourceField, sampleInclusion and orderModeBound. From ResearchFormalCoreR1: regressionKernel, prwMeasure, egm_weight, gm8FiniteM8 and the normalizer limits. Intermediate kernel/regression theorems take hG : IsUnit (sourcePinCovarianceAt L r); the final compositions do not. Generic modules: GaussianRegressionLimits needs block convergence of G, C, B and d along a filter, plus IsUnit G0. ContactJetCovariance needs summable coefficient rows, c ≠ 0, nonzero amplitudes and seven witness-column identities. GaussianWeightedMajorants needs a countable index, a probability measure and measurable coordinates, each with law gaussianReal 0 1 (no independence). It also needs nonnegative summable weights, and 0 < ∑ w for the tail. ConfluentIntegralIdentities needs ContDiff ℝ 3 F or ContDiff ℝ 2 H, and r ≠ 0.",
