+      "source_self_limits": "The source states: Scientific effect NONE, and the full original research goal remains active. Several items remain open: whole-field geometric Kac–Rice/Palm identification, transfer to arbitrary field-dependent geometric events, Morse/elder/counting, GT5, P0.2 and the parent conclusions (README.md:7,32; SCOPE.md:37; FIELD_CONDITIONING.md:112-117). Constants may depend on L and b, and no uniformity over unbounded height is asserted (README.md:30). The weighted law is an explicit normalized-density source probability, not a geometric Palm disintegration (FIELD_CONDITIONING.md:51-55; SourceSmoothPalm.lean:11-13). The derivative covariance pairing is not identified with theta-kernel derivatives (SCOPE.md:9; SourceDerivativeGaussian.lean:174-175). ContactJetCovariance is a generic certificate and GaussianRegressionLimits a generic matrix theorem (SCOPE.md:11,23). The source frames the prescribed-null-pin kernel value as an explicit specified formula, not an arbitrary conditional-law version (SourcePhysicalEndpointKernel.lean:6-10; SCOPE.md:33). Different-family scientific review is pending. Packaging ran no Lean, kernel or tests, and reuses earlier author-side verification (README.md:34,38; FIELD_CONDITIONING.md:109-110; EVIDENCE_CATALOG.json verification_reuse). Three derivative/contact/continuity groups and the regression-limits group have only author-history source association (EVIDENCE_SUMMARY.md:60-67; AUTHOR_HISTORY_SUPPLEMENT.json). Two helper exports have transitive rather than direct axiom output (AXIOM_COVERAGE_ADDENDUM.json).",
