+      "reason": "README.md lines 3-9 state \"Scientific effect: NONE.\" They describe the record as a re-execution of the zeta fold exploration packet's numerics with byte comparison against committed outputs, and say it \"is not a theorem, an acceptance, or a read of the packet's mathematics\". Lines 16-30 pin the packet at 0a7e5145 and its open slice C. Lines 87-93 and 140-143 record reruns of dbn/indep_ht.py under other backends and versions, including two earlier preserved script versions. Lines 101-125 report 50 byte-identical, 14 timing-only and 2 different outputs, with 9/9 raw samples matching. They also report an independent seed-8675309 check whose zero counts agree with mpmath.nzeros. Lines 127-143 describe the two residual-trail differences, and lines 145-174 the limitations, including that the trail discrepancy is unexplained. The comparison files are outputs of that comparison: comparison/COMPARE.md lines 1-71, compare.json, hashes.json (summary IDENTICAL 50 / TIMING-ONLY 14 / DIFFERENT 2), ledger.json (59 job rows) and timing_mask_rules.txt. experiments/INDEX.json and the *_env.txt files record backend/version variants. reproduced/ holds the rerun bytes and indep_check.json. The record only agrees or disagrees with the named packet and script versions.",
