+            "issue": "INDEX_v6.md:14 was given as an example of a closing line that begins 'Next:'. It actually begins 'Next meta focus after this:'. I counted the closing lines again across all 87 files: 60 begin 'Next:' (v9, v33, v35-v92), 22 begin '`#90` still OPEN' (v12-v32, v34), and v5, v6, v7, v10 and v11 begin otherwise. Corrected."
