+      "classification": "NOT_OBLIGATION",
+      "title": "Meta-framework merge receipts for main PRs 126-189 (note-only)",
+      "reason": "Each of these 47 MAIN_PR*_MERGED.md files is a meta-framework merge receipt for a PR on repository main. Each has a Date line at line 3, merge and head OIDs at lines 4-5, and a '**Scientific effect:** NONE.' line at line 6 (line 7 in MAIN_PR145_PUBLIC_SHOP_MERGED.md, MAIN_PR147_INTAKE_EXAMPLE_MERGED.md and MAIN_PR150_SIDE24_CHART_MERGED.md). Each has a '## Why note-only' section saying main is not in the catalog fetch allowlist (e.g. MAIN_PR126_V34_CUSTODY_MERGED.md:8-10) and a '## Non-claims' list (e.g. MAIN_PR134_CLAIMS_FIREWALL_MERGED.md:16-18, 'No mathematical review'). 32 files also have a 'Diff surface' or 'Surfaces' path list starting at line 12 (e.g. MAIN_PR135_INTERVAL_PROSE_MERGED.md:12-17). The other 15 have no such section: MAIN_PR138, 139, 145, 147, 149, 150, 151, 152, 153, 155, 156, 157, 158, 162 and 164. Where a main PR touched mathematical material, the note only names the path and disclaims acceptance. MAIN_PR161_LB_RATE_HOLD_MERGED.md:6 says it 'Does not accept Q0-C101 upper cubic rate or invent a numerical `C_Q0`'. Its line 16 names `reviews/lb_rate_thm023_landing_20260926/REVIEW.md` with a role label listing that remote review's AMEND topics ('F2 intensity, C031 dual docs, §3 constants, 0.0334 grading'), and states no value as its own claim. MAIN_PR135_INTERVAL_PROSE_MERGED.md:6 and :16-17 list `research/interval/README.md` and `tests/test_interval.py` as changed paths. Each carries a one-phrase change label ('measured collapse thresholds vs heuristic fit'; 'lower/upper rational comparisons; NC13/NC14 controls'), and no threshold or bound value is stated. MAIN_PR170_GROK_PART1_MERGED.md:14 names `checks/pr82_quartic_det_check.py` only as a path. MAIN_PR126_V34_CUSTODY_MERGED.md:6 says 'Custody only for Issue #117 objects; theorem not accepted'. MAIN_PR178_FORMAL_LAYER1_MERGED.md:19 says the PR does not accept Math- PR93 and does not promote the SIDE24 Lean pilot to prize status. None of these files states a theorem, bound, constant, identity or certificate of its own. They are receipts and routing notes.",
