+            "field": "items[math-pr-catalog-notes].source_self_limits",
+            "issue": "It said 'Most add No mathematical review; no independence credit claimed by meta-framework'. A mechanical count at 0f5894f8 finds that line in only 15 of the 33 files: MATH_PR53, 70 (hardening), 80, 81, 82, 83, 84, 86, 87, 88, 89, 92, 94, 95 and 96. MATH_PR85:21 has only 'No independence credit claimed by meta-framework.' Corrected to the exact count."
