+            "issue": "The list of status notes 'without path tables' left out MATH_PR15_MERGED.md, which has no path table (only an artifact SHA256 at :15). It also did not say that MATH_D5_LANDING_20260926.md:8-13 is a PR/head/merge/package-directory table with no bytes or SHA256. Both corrected."
