+            "issue": "It paraphrased MAIN_PR178_FORMAL_LAYER1_MERGED.md:19 as saying the SIDE24 Lean pilot 'is not promoted'. The line says the note does not accept Math- PR93 and does not promote the pilot 'to prize status'. MAIN_PR135:16-17 carry one-phrase change labels, not bare paths. Both made precise. Classification unchanged."
